<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MagneTek raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MagneTek raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it raised its recommendation MagneTek Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 14-5/8, a new year-high, in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
